# Finder-style duplicates ("SKILL 2.md", "detect 3.mjs") that tooling writes
# alongside existing files. 166 were committed by accident in Aug 2026, all
# byte-identical to the file they shadowed.
#
# Scoped to .claude/ on purpose. A repo-wide "* [0-9].*" would also silently
# ignore real content — a classroom photo saved as "reading corner 2.jpg"
# would never deploy and the reason would be invisible. Duplicates elsewhere
# get caught in review instead.
.claude/**/* [0-9].*
